      "subject": "feat(executive): talk to the Chief Agent and hear its replies (EW-1f)",
      "body": "Adds voice to the Executive Office conversation with the browser's own speech engines, the owner's choice for a first version: the microphone dictates into the message box and sends when the owner pauses, and replies (including the opening briefing) can be read aloud, with a Voice toggle that reads each new answer as it arrives. Nothing is recorded or stored by KoreLumina; Chrome transcribes through Google and Safari through Apple, and read-aloud runs locally. Long hashes and canonical ids are skipped when reading aloud. Browsers without speech recognition keep the microphone disabled and say why. A Runtime voice (Whisper and OpenAI TTS) can replace the engine later without changing the controls.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AHtXdN7VRusNxTFHzk5uFe",
